- id: apartment_improvement_records
  name: Apartment Improvement Records
  description: Records of renovations or capital improvements claimed by the landlord
    to justify rent increases, often challenged for accuracy.
  jurisdiction: NYS
  status: proposed
  aliases: &id001 []
  _bootstrap:
    sources:
    - https://www.courtlistener.com/opinion/10131664/matter-of-aidekman-v-state-of-ny-div-of-hous-community-renewal/
    sample_quotes:
    - The landlord's records of individual apartment improvements were scrutinized
      for compliance with regulatory requirements.
    suggested_aliases: *id001
- id: bedbug_inspection_report
  name: Bedbug Inspection Report
  description: A professional report documenting the presence or absence of bedbugs
    in the premises, often used to support habitability claims.
  jurisdiction: NYC
  status: proposed
  aliases: &id002 []
  _bootstrap:
    sources:
    - https://www.courtlistener.com/opinion/6314797/46-downing-street-llc-v-thompson/
    sample_quotes:
    - An inspection report confirmed the presence of bedbugs in the apartment.
    suggested_aliases: *id002
- id: building_ownership_records
